<view class="page flow-page">
  <view class="flow-head"><view class="back-icon pressable" aria-label="返回" bindtap="goBack" hover-class="pressable-hover"><image class="icon-image" src="../../images/ui/back.svg" mode="aspectFit"/></view><view class="eyebrow">NewHz / SUPPORT</view></view>
  <view class="title">退款说明</view>
  <view class="copy">如果生成失败，或支付后无法查看完整报告，可以在这里提交退款帮助。</view>
  <view class="surface refund-card">
    <view class="section-title">适用情况</view>
    <view class="refund-row"><text class="refund-index">01</text><text>试色生成失败且无法重新生成</text></view>
    <view class="refund-row"><text class="refund-index">02</text><text>已支付但报告暂时不可查看</text></view>
    <view class="refund-row"><text class="refund-index">03</text><text>退款将通过微信支付商户平台处理</text></view>
  </view>
  <button class="primary-button" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="requestRefund">提交退款帮助</button>
  <view wx:if="{{feedback}}" class="feedback">{{feedback}}</view>
</view>
